    <briefdescription>
<para>A <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_hash_node" kindref="compound">HashNode</ref> is an entry in an <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_outlined_hash_tree" kindref="compound">OutlinedHashTree</ref>, holding a hash value and a collection of Successors (other HashNodes). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>If a <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_hash_node" kindref="compound">HashNode</ref> has a positive terminal value (Terminals &gt; 0), it signifies the end of a hash sequence with that occurrence count. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
